2,887,794,796,607,370,878,774,387],[181,307,745,149,402,361,367,144,458,693,796,753,584]],"speakerNameZh":"貝克威","speakerGlyphs":[60,61,62],"portraitId":13,"linesZhTw":["『這條路是通往王城的要道，","　雖然走這條路較快，但遇到","　王國守備軍的機會也較高…"],"linesZhCn":["『这条路是通往王城的要道，","　虽然走这条路较快，但遇到","　王国守备军的机会也较高…"],"linesEn":["This road is the main thoroughfare to the capital.","While it's the fastest route, the chances of running","into the royal garrison are high..."]},{"speaker":13,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[181,584,560]],"speakerNameZh":"貝克威","speakerGlyphs":[60,61,62],"portraitId":13,"linesZhTw":["　…』"],"linesZhCn":["　…』"],"linesEn":["...Right on cue."]},{"speaker":1,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,605,534,367,399,950,370,568,339,449,658,387,341],[181,581,560]],"speakerNameZh":"哈諾","speakerGlyphs":[38,39],"portraitId":1,"linesZhTw":["『你說的沒錯，我已經看到了","　。』"],"linesZhCn":["『你说的没错，我已经看到了","　。』"],"linesEn":["You're not wrong about that.","I can already see them ahead!"]}],[{"speaker":83,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,493,651,151,624,98,486,360,345,343,395,494,80],[181,495,496,730,739,367,1031,1032,370,600,600,468,568],[181,78,559,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"突擊騎兵","speakerGlyphs":[112,113,95,94],"portraitId":83,"linesZhTw":["『前面那批人一定就是在普里","　茲港逞兇的匪徒，通通給我","　拿下！』"],"linesZhCn":["『前面那批人一定就是在普里","　兹港逞凶的匪徒，通通给我","　拿下！』"],"linesEn":["Those people ahead must be the scoundrels who caused trouble at Port Prits!","Seize every last one of them!"]},{"speaker":8,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,352,352,370,125,137,634,343,906,907,98,370],[181,462,343,486,355,817,458,584,584,560]],"speakerNameZh":"希莉亞","speakerGlyphs":[51,52,43],"portraitId":8,"linesZhTw":["『等等，大家都是自己人，","　這是一場誤會……』"],"linesZhCn":["『等等，大家都是自己人，","　这是一场误会……』"],"linesEn":["Wait! We're on the same side!","This is all a misunderstanding...!"]},{"speaker":83,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,447,844,1059,1060,1061,659,1062,1063,575,801,341,581],[181,645,645,367,642,515,358,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"突擊騎兵","speakerGlyphs":[112,113,95,94],"portraitId":83,"linesZhTw":["『少玩弄詭計想拖延時間了。","　乖乖的受死吧！』"],"linesZhCn":["『少玩弄诡计想拖延时间了。","　乖乖的受死吧！』"],"linesEn":["Save your tricks! You won't stall for time on my watch.","Surrender and face your fate!"]},{"speaker":8,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,825,370,534,346,600,370],[181,865,369,199,373,313,534,341,581],[181,36,37,370,568,569,391,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"希莉亞","speakerGlyphs":[51,52,43],"portraitId":8,"linesZhTw":["『唉，說不通，","　只好先打再說了。","　索爾，我們上！』"],"linesZhCn":["『唉，说不通，","　只好先打再说了。","　索尔，我们上！』"],"linesEn":["Ugh, there's no reasoning with them.","We'll have to fight our way through. Thor, let's go!"]},{"speaker":0,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,464,180,568,399,637,638,370],[181,583,906,907,65,334,188,255,448,370],[181,346,334,797,1064,820,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"索爾","speakerGlyphs":[36,37],"portraitId":0,"linesZhTw":["『啊？我沒問題，","　妳自己可要小心點，","　不要太勉強！』"],"linesZhCn":["『啊？我没问题，","　你自己可要小心点，","　不要太勉强！』"],"linesEn":["Right, I'm ready!","Just be careful yourself, and don't overdo it!"]},{"speaker":8,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,36,37,370,82,82,605,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"希莉亞","speakerGlyphs":[51,52,43],"portraitId":8,"linesZhTw":["『索爾，謝謝你！』"],"linesZhCn":["『索尔，谢谢你！』"],"linesEn":["Thank you, Thor!"]}],[{"speaker":12,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,691,657,342,486,125,611,164,98,904,135,486,463],[181,188,1065,1066,370,346,1067,386,392,1068,338,180,560]],"speakerNameZh":"凱麗","speakerGlyphs":[58,59],"portraitId":12,"linesZhTw":["『哎呀！一大群男人追殺一個","　小姑娘，不覺得丟臉嗎？』"],"linesZhCn":["『哎呀！一大群男人追杀一个","　小姑娘，不觉得丢脸吗？』"],"linesEn":["Oh my! A whole squad of men ganging up on a lone girl?","Don't you have any shame?"]},{"speaker":83,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,583,367,486,238,725,568,367,1001,559,386,417,1069],[181,167,463,1070,370,306,938,1071,373,307,745,1072,361],[181,65,343,296,1073,370,645,645,367,889,568,310,380]],"speakerSlot":34,"speakerNameZh":"突擊騎兵","speakerGlyphs":[112,113,95,94],"portraitId":83,"linesZhTw":["『妳的一拳讓我的部下得療養","　三個月，無故毆打王國駐軍","　可是重罪，乖乖的跟我回去"],"linesZhCn":["『你的一拳让我的部下得疗养","　三个月，无故殴打王国驻军","　可是重罪，乖乖的跟我回去"],"linesEn":["One punch from you put my man in the infirmary for three months!","Assaulting the royal garrison is a grave offense!"]},{"speaker":83,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[181,534,463,1074,257,358,342,560]],"speakerSlot":34,"speakerNameZh":"突擊騎兵","speakerGlyphs":[112,113,95,94],"portraitId":83,"linesZhTw":["　說個明白吧！』"],"linesZhCn":["　说个明白吧！』"],"linesEn":["Surrender quietly and come answer for what you did!"]},{"speaker":12,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,469,457,175,716,568,655,1075,342,605,569,307,745],[181,361,634,343,462,463,696,291,367,338,180,560]],"speakerNameZh":"凱麗","speakerGlyphs":[58,59],"portraitId":12,"linesZhTw":["『誰教他對我亂瞄！你們王國","　軍都是這個樣子的嗎？』"],"linesZhCn":["『谁教他对我乱瞄！你们王国","　军都是这个样子的吗？』"],"linesEn":["He had it coming for staring at me like that!","Is this how all soldiers of the kingdom behave?!"]},{"speaker":83,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,711,584,584,346,647,583,663,341,370],[181,468,568,1021,381,579,342,560]],"speakerSlot":34,"speakerNameZh":"突擊騎兵","speakerGlyphs":[112,113,95,94],"portraitId":83,"linesZhTw":["『哼……不和妳吵了，","　給我抓起來！』"],"linesZhCn":["『哼……不和你吵了，","　给我抓起来！』"],"linesEn":["Hmph... Enough banter!","Apprehend her at once!"]},{"speaker":1,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,701,342,151,533,400,307,745,361,395,1076,435,486],[181,463,188,161,729,370,462,343,672,344,486,310],[181,536,180,560]],"speakerNameZh":"哈諾","speakerGlyphs":[38,39],"portraitId":1,"linesZhTw":["『咦！那邊有王國軍在圍攻一","　個小女孩，這是怎麼一回","　事？』"],"linesZhCn":["『咦！那边有王国军在围攻一","　个小女孩，这是怎么一回","　事？』"],"linesEn":["Huh?! The royal troops are cornering a young girl over there!","What in the world is going on?"]},{"speaker":13,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,644,370,568,569,906,907,634,1005,346,341,341,370],[181,346,334,313,380,684,685,686,584,584,560]],"speakerNameZh":"貝克威","speakerGlyphs":[60,61,62],"portraitId":13,"linesZhTw":["『喂，我們自己都顧不了了，","　不要再去湊熱鬧……』"],"linesZhCn":["『喂，我们自己都顾不了了，","　不要再去凑热闹……』"],"linesEn":["Hey, we can barely keep ourselves out of trouble as it is.","Don't go sticking your nose into a hornet's nest..."]},{"speaker":0,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,411,344,342,605,428,256,1077,1077,367,658,690,486],[181,611,307,745,361,1078,897,486,463,188,161,729,180],[181,568,906,907,380,706,707,175,569,369,341,581,560]],"speakerNameZh":"索爾","speakerGlyphs":[36,37],"portraitId":0,"linesZhTw":["『什麼！你能眼睜睜的看著一","　群王國軍欺負一個小女孩？","　我自己去收拾他們好了。』"],"linesZhCn":["『什么！你能眼睁睁的看着一","　群王国军欺负一个小女孩？","　我自己去收拾他们好了。』"],"linesEn":["What?! How can you just stand by and watch soldiers bully a girl?","Fine, I'll go take care of them myself!"]},{"speaker":4,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,369,643,369,643,370],[181,568,632,605,380,345,343,341,370],[181,936,740,346,802,462,694,463,584,584,560]],"speakerNameZh":"亞雷斯","speakerGlyphs":[43,44,45],"portraitId":4,"linesZhTw":["『好啦好啦，","　我陪你去就是了，","　反正不差這幾個……』"],"linesZhCn":["『好啦好啦，","　我陪你去就是了，","　反正不差这几个……』"],"linesEn":["All right, all right, I'm coming with you.","A few more enemies won't make much difference at this point..."]},{"speaker":13,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,369,358,370,151,345,391,358,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"貝克威","speakerGlyphs":[60,61,62],"portraitId":13,"linesZhTw":["『好吧，那就上吧！』"],"linesZhCn":["『好吧，那就上吧！』"],"linesEn":["Very well. Let's move in!"]}],[{"speaker":83,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,65,102,584,745,307,1079,559,370,568,346,428,313],[181,194,150,404,341,584,350,508,1080,724,559,367],[181,306,428,584,560]],"speakerSlot":33,"speakerNameZh":"突擊騎兵","speakerGlyphs":[112,113,95,94],"portraitId":83,"linesZhTw":["『可惡…國王陛下，我不能再","　護衛您了…請原諒屬下的","　無能…』"],"linesZhCn":["『可恶…国王陛下，我不能再","　护卫您了…请原谅属下的","　无能…』"],"linesEn":["Curse it all... Your Majesty, I can guard you no longer...","Forgive my failure..."]},{"speaker":8,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,605,1059,950,341,370,568,569,346,343,579,434,965],[181,745,307,367,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"希莉亞","speakerGlyphs":[51,52,43],"portraitId":8,"linesZhTw":["『你弄錯了，我們不是來加害","　國王的！』"],"linesZhCn":["『你弄错了，我们不是来加害","　国王的！』"],"linesEn":["You're mistaken!","We haven't come to harm the King!"]},{"speaker":83,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,343,338,180,584,151,344,584,493,608,771,291,387],[181,664,343,469,584,584,464,584,584,560]],"speakerSlot":33,"speakerNameZh":"突擊騎兵","speakerGlyphs":[112,113,95,94],"portraitId":83,"linesZhTw":["『是嗎？…那麼…前些日子到","　底是誰……啊……』"],"linesZhCn":["『是吗？…那么…前些日子到","　底是谁……啊……』"],"linesEn":["Is that so...? Then... who was it the other day...?","Ugh...!"]}],[{"speaker":12,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,70,82,605,569,367,678,679,342,293,307,745,367],[181,99,1081,1001,140,693,346,343,605,569,716,118,370],[181,605,569,387,664,343,411,344,579,676,180,560]],"speakerNameZh":"凱麗","speakerGlyphs":[58,59],"portraitId":12,"linesZhTw":["『多謝你們的幫忙！連王國的","　精銳部隊也不是你們對手，","　你們到底是什麼來歷？』"],"linesZhCn":["『多谢你们的帮忙！连王国的","　精锐部队也不是你们对手，","　你们到底是什么来历？』"],"linesEn":["Thanks for lending a hand! Even the kingdom's elite couldn't hold a candle to you.","Who in the world are you people?"]},{"speaker":0,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,462,463,534,381,579,738,316,720,370,570,114,712],[181,738,799,894,370,568,658,583,465,343,310,137,1082],[181,1067,369,341,581,560]],"speakerNameZh":"索爾","speakerGlyphs":[36,37],"portraitId":0,"linesZhTw":["『這個說起來很麻煩，此地又","　很危險，我看妳還是回家睡","　覺好了。』"],"linesZhCn":["『这个说起来很麻烦，此地又","　很危险，我看你还是回家睡","　觉好了。』"],"linesEn":["It's a long story, and it's dangerous around here.","I think you'd be better off heading home to get some rest."]},{"speaker":12,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,411,344,370,605,592,767,188,658,568,342,681,343],[181,561,387,568,602,121,367,902,264,370,1083,803,605],[181,1084,486,125,1085,584,584,560]],"speakerNameZh":"凱麗","speakerGlyphs":[58,59],"portraitId":12,"linesZhTw":["『什麼，你竟敢小看我！若是","　聽到我老師的名字，包準你","　嚇一大跳……』"],"linesZhCn":["『什么，你竟敢小看我！若是","　听到我老师的名字，包准你","　吓一大跳……』"],"linesEn":["What?! How dare you look down on me!","If you heard who my master is, your jaw would hit the floor..."]},{"speaker":13,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,58,59,188,864,370,583,367,390,118,367,555,343],[181,738,346,950,370,65,401,350,637,583,367,602,121],[181,343,857,486,751,338,180,560]],"speakerNameZh":"貝克威","speakerGlyphs":[60,61,62],"portraitId":13,"linesZhTw":["『凱麗小姐，妳的身手的確是","　很不錯，可以請問妳的老師","　是哪一位嗎？』"],"linesZhCn":["『凯丽小姐，你的身手的确是","　很不错，可以请问你的老师","　是哪一位吗？』"],"linesEn":["Lady Carrie, your martial skill is undeniable.","May we ask who your master might be?"]},{"speaker":12,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,462,463,584,465,343,346,428,831,914,605,342],[181,346,563,370,697,437,605,569,1086,692,725,568,434],[181,471,367,652,370,568,65,401,1087,1088,1089,1090,486]],"speakerNameZh":"凱麗","speakerGlyphs":[58,59],"portraitId":12,"linesZhTw":["『這個…還是不能告訴你！","　不過，如果你們願意讓我加","　入的話，我可以考慮透露一"],"linesZhCn":["『这个…还是不能告诉你！","　不过，如果你们愿意让我加","　入的话，我可以考虑透露一"],"linesEn":["Well... that's still a secret!","Although, if you let me travel with you, I might consider revealing..."]},{"speaker":12,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[181,448,581,560]],"speakerNameZh":"凱麗","speakerGlyphs":[58,59],"portraitId":12,"linesZhTw":["　點。』"],"linesZhCn":["　点。』"],"linesEn":["...just a little bit!"]},{"speaker":13,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,407,408,342,568,569,345,334,647,307,745,361],[181,125,105,370,740,1091,98,118,346,406,370,400,583],[181,434,471,589,343,313,369,346,563,341,581,560]],"speakerNameZh":"貝克威","speakerGlyphs":[60,61,62],"portraitId":13,"linesZhTw":["『歡迎！我們就要和王國軍","　大戰，正愁人手不夠，有妳","　加入真是再好不過了。』"],"linesZhCn":["『欢迎！我们就要和王国军","　大战，正愁人手不够，有你","　加入真是再好不过了。』"],"linesEn":["You're more than welcome! We're about to face the royal army in full force,","and we're short-handed. Having you with us is a great help."]},{"speaker":12,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,401,733,568,569,345,343,609,793,341,370],[181,350,125,137,70,70,222,457,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"凱麗","speakerGlyphs":[58,59],"portraitId":12,"linesZhTw":["『以後我們就是伙伴了，","　請大家多多指教！』"],"linesZhCn":["『以后我们就是伙伴了，","　请大家多多指教！』"],"linesEn":["Then we're partners from here on out!","I look forward to fighting alongside you all!"]},{"speaker":4,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,570,114,346,1092,587,836,370],[181,58,59,188,864,370],[181,568,569,462,345,391,794,358,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"亞雷斯","speakerGlyphs":[43,44,45],"portraitId":4,"linesZhTw":["『此地不宜久留，","　凱麗小姐，","　我們這就上路吧！』"],"linesZhCn":["『此地不宜久留，","　凯丽小姐，","　我们这就上路吧！』"],"linesEn":["We shouldn't linger here for long.","Lady Carrie, let's get moving!"]}],[{"speaker":4,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,658,579,568,569,712,340,98,137,817,458,341],[181,370,36,37,370,371,395,568,569,671,672,344,673],[181,180,560]],"speakerNameZh":"亞雷斯","speakerGlyphs":[43,44,45],"portraitId":4,"linesZhTw":["『看來我們又被人家誤會了","　，索爾，現在我們該怎麼辦","　？』"],"linesZhCn":["『看来我们又被人家误会了","　，索尔，现在我们该怎么办","　？』"],"linesEn":["Looks like another misunderstanding.","Thor, what do you want to do now?"]},{"speaker":0,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,151,465,689,534,370,721,654,343,135,364,307],[181,497,380,1059,463,1074,257,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"索爾","speakerGlyphs":[36,37],"portraitId":0,"linesZhTw":["『那還用說，當然是殺進王","　城去弄個明白！』"],"linesZhCn":["『那还用说，当然是杀进王","　城去弄个明白！』"],"linesEn":["Isn't it obvious?","We fight our way straight into the capital and clear our names!"]},{"speaker":10,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,585,370,406,761,1093,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"瑪琳","speakerGlyphs":[55,56],"portraitId":10,"linesZhTw":["『嗯，夠氣魄！』"],"linesZhCn":["『嗯，够气魄！』"],"linesEn":["Heh, now that's the spirit!"]},{"speaker":8,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,568,569,607,391,794,358,342,462,272,536,346],[181,1059,463,822,823,370,1094,316,720,367,536,465,395],[181,733,129,470,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"希莉亞","speakerGlyphs":[51,52,43],"portraitId":8,"linesZhTw":["『我們快上路吧！這件事不","　弄個清楚，更麻煩的事還在","　後頭呢！』"],"linesZhCn":["『我们快上路吧！这件事不","　弄个清楚，更麻烦的事还在","　后头呢！』"],"linesEn":["Let's make haste! If we don't clear this up soon,","even greater trouble will be waiting for us down the road!"]}]]}